Package: linop.hilbert
Title: Certified Finite Sections of Self-Adjoint Operators on Sequence Spaces
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Gilles", "Colling", email = "gilles.colling051@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3070-6066"))
Description: Operators on the sequence space l^2(Z) that are approximated by
    truncation to a finite block. A discrete Schrodinger operator built from a
    finitely supported potential is discretised to a 'linop', its isolated
    eigenvalues are computed on that discretisation, and each one comes back with
    a certificate bounding its distance to the spectrum of the original operator.
    The bound is closed form, needs two entries of the computed eigenvector, and
    rests on the essential spectrum being known from the limiting coefficients.
